65","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121586","id":5036567865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLDPtOQ","user":{"login":"ajreckof","id":66184050,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTg0MDUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66184050?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof","html_url":"https://github.com/ajreckof","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ajreckof/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T16:37:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T16:37:38Z","body":"I agree that this is fairly hacky but I thought it would be better to keep it out of the respectives EditorProperty as it is not really what they are used for and it is more linked to this specific use. \r\nIf you think it would be a better idea to make each class handle it. I can easily make an alternative PR to do so.\r\nI could make it a virtual method called maybe `make_label` that EditorProperty could override with the correct action to make them passthrough when used as a label or maybe a boolean that would be called used_as_label. \r\nWhat do you think?\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5036567865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimiz